## Vexi API env vars (v1)
##
## Never commit real secrets. `api/.env` is ignored by git.

## Required for embeddings (insert/update embedded fields), search, and reindex.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

## Vector dimension expected by LanceDB FixedSizeList vectors.
## Must match the embedding model output dimension.
VEXI_VECTOR_DIM=768

## Where LanceDB stores its data.
## Default: .lancedb
LANCEDB_URI=.lancedb

## Optional: enable debug endpoints like GET /registry.
VEXI_DEBUG=0
